+# BLUE CURRENT V49.30.0 — V49 RELEASE CLOSURE & CERTIFICATION
+
+V49 is complete.
+
+## V49 controlled rollout chain
+
+ACTIVATE → TECHNICAL → PACKAGE → CUTOVER → STABILIZE
+
+V49.30 introduces one read-only certification surface that verifies both:
+
+1. the architecture / human-control contracts, and
+2. the current real rollout state.
+
+These are intentionally reported separately so Blue Current never presents an unexecuted rollout as a completed live deployment.
+
+## Architecture certification contracts
+
+### 1. Activation approval remains human controlled
+- explicit human approval required
+- automatic approval false
+- automatic activation false
+- automatic deployment false
+
+### 2. Technical go-live authorization remains separate from cutover
+- human go-live authorization required
+- authorization does not deploy
+- automatic provisioning false
+- automatic cutover false
+- automatic go-live false
+
+### 3. Deployment package remains separate from execution
+- package preparation does not deploy
+- deployment execution is separate
+- automatic provisioning false
+- automatic deployment false
+- automatic cutover false
+
+### 4. Production cutover remains manually controlled
+- explicit execution authorization required
+- authorization does not execute deployment
+- result recording is manual
+- automated cutover false
+- autonomous production deployment false
+
+### 5. Stabilization / rollback remain human decisions
+- observations are human recorded
+- rollback recommendation is advisory
+- human stabilization declaration required
+- autonomous rollback false
+- automatic stable declaration false
+
+## Certification states
+
+The certification endpoint can return:
+
+- `V49-CERTIFIED-LIVE`
+  - all architecture contracts pass
+  - current rollout reached a human STABLE declaration across launched locations
+
+- `V49-ARCHITECTURE-CERTIFIED`
+  - all architecture contracts pass
+  - the real rollout has not yet completed the full live chain
+
+- `V49-CERTIFICATION-FAILED`
+  - one or more human-control architecture contracts failed
+
+## Current authenticated Chefs runtime
+
+The untouched authoritative runtime currently reports:
+
+- certification: `V49-ARCHITECTURE-CERTIFIED`
+- architecture contracts: 5/5
+- live-state contracts: 0/5
+
+Current real chain:
+
+- ACTIVATE → `rollout-plan-required`
+- TECHNICAL → `activation-plan-required`
+- PACKAGE → `technical-plan-required`
+- CUTOVER → `deployment-package-required`
+- STABILIZE → `successful-cutover-required`
+
+This is the correct result. The code architecture is certified, but the real production rollout workflow has not been executed. Blue Current does not fabricate live deployment evidence.
+
+## API
+
+GET `/api/v49-release-certification`
+
+The endpoint is read-only.
+
